((pulsa)) (wie ((AH)))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>((pulcra))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-ce023555-683e-41c1-b64f-8bc314167f92" endid="#m-4efc4118-2a4e-4cc4-b1b9-e8ac53703883" type="emendation"><table><tr><td><rend>((lacrimosi cespidis)) (wie ((AH)))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>((lacrima sices piscis))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-99c4d007-daa1-485b-bb9e-47810bd3753a" endid="#m-7f527d5f-753e-4244-b946-68cbbbd22ebf" type="emendation"><table><tr><td><rend>((iugo)) (wie ((AH)))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>((iuge))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-ab04fc73-edb3-4b33-bb66-b6e8a2af88b2" endid="#m-151f4092-b8f1-43ce-8186-518b33f0249d" type="emendation"><table><tr><td><rend>((frequentia)) (wie ((AH)))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>((frequenta))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-d2ad905d-6710-4b78-91b2-f40b082e4b35" endid="#m-022baee0-07de-4e9f-b62d-5f45502303f3" type="emendation"><table><tr><td><rend>((presens uilia)) (wie ((AH)))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>((pre sen dulia))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-6b15e9b4-05c0-48b7-80d3-e4e2acaa6e2b" endid="#m-2fca138b-6944-4384-9ba7-5218a77fc8ff" type="emendation"><table><tr><td><rend>((tribulatur)) (wie ((AH)))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>((tribulator))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-d558d866-e514-4082-b9c2-807f08f16204" endid="#m-d58a28e4-7db5-4274-bf34-0d5711970c12"><table><tr><td><rend>((†multa ... causa†))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>die Zeile ist offenbar zu lang, die Emendation in ((AH)): ((altera)) macht sie weder verständlich noch kürzer.</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-cee8c888-b956-4b37-8543-5c3ed9b23f42" endid="#m-09cdedc9-fd5f-49cc-8684-199b63451a21"><table><tr><td><rend>((totondens))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>semantisch plausibler: ((tutundens)) (wie ((AH))).</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-dc032fa8-127d-4681-bcaf-d042cea97fba" endid="#m-f8c29527-15b0-400e-b460-69f1f95d1be8"><table><tr><td><rend>((husia))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>lies ((usia))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-f4ab893d-9b23-4d5a-ba74-ce60e669f9eb" endid="#m-11bbf35f-5e48-4cca-bd07-aec354df19bd"><table><tr><td><rend>((Sed iam canamus alleluia))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>Der Textschreiber hat auf ((iam)) und ((-na-)) Platz für Melismen gelassen.</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-2c2750c2-949a-4741-8536-37c40023b357" endid="#m-a33aab8b-43d1-40ad-bf76-d51c65e3cb8f" type="emendation"><table><tr><td><rend>((solaris)) (wie ((AH)))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>((solarus))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot startid="#m-1b483db0-80ac-4087-9c4b-3d8ebb5cd601" endid="#m-4ee481f8-b025-45ba-b765-3ec1fd343f81" type="emendation"><table><tr><td><rend>((laboris)) (wie ((AH)))</rend></td><td><rend>]</rend></td><td><rend>((labous))</rend></td></tr></table></annot><annot type="global-comment"><table><tr><td><rend>Der nur hier belegte, schwer verständliche und offenbar schlecht überlieferte Text erscheint ohne Notation, passt aber zur Melodie ((Lyra)), vgl. ((Pa 1118-163v-10, Pa 1118-174v-7, Pa 1118-237v-5)). In den Strophen 5 und 7 müsste man eine Textunterlegung annehmen wie in ((Agnus dei Christus)), </rend></td></tr></table></annot></notesStmt><sourceDesc><source xml:id="wit-pa-1118"><bibl><identifier type="siglum">Pa 1118</identifier></bibl></source></sourceDesc></fileDesc><encodingDesc><appInfo><application version="0.9.1"><name>Monodi-Zero</name></application></appInfo></encodingDesc><workList><work><identifier>Pa 1118-175v-4</identifier><title>Miserere facti</title><incip><incipText><p>Miserere facti</p></incipText></incip><contents><contentItem><locus from="175v">f. 175v, l. 4</locus></contentItem></contents><biblList><bibl>AH 7, 263</bibl></biblList><cla